{"about_the_game":"<strong>RUNES Magica</strong> is a 2D loglike magic action game.<br><br>You go on a journey as &quot;Lunia,&quot; a girl wizard who lost her father to a false charge.<br>Defeat the knight king who has been the cause of everything and complete your revenge.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><br>\u25a0 <strong>Rune system</strong><br>Lunia uses rune magic completed by her father.<br>Discover new runes through runes synthesis and use diverse spells.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908500/extras/e95fd3eec0620c290586f679fca55500.poster.avif?t=1688284089\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908500/extras/e95fd3eec0620c290586f679fca55500.webm?t=1688284089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908500/extras/e95fd3eec0620c290586f679fca55500.mp4?t=1688284089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u25a0 <strong>Relic</strong><br>Complete the best combination with 70 artifacts.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908500/extras/db893bf3b089f2e347bf77a76b8d6fa9.avif?t=1688284089\" width=352 height=256 /></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908500/extras/1b54c18083c2d12c69cfb7f2519f1840.poster.avif?t=1688284089\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908500/extras/1b54c18083c2d12c69cfb7f2519f1840.webm?t=1688284089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908500/extras/1b54c18083c2d12c69cfb7f2519f1840.mp4?